# Accepted risks. Read by Trivy (image scan) and by the pip-audit step in .github/workflows/security.yml.
# Every entry needs a reason and an exp: date; Trivy fails again after that date, which forces a recheck.

# pillow 12.3.0 in assistant-service (fixed in 13.0.0)
# Why accepted: pillow is only there because fastembed imports it at package load, and every
# fastembed release (0.8.1, 0.9.0) requires pillow<13. We only use TextEmbedding, which never
# decodes images, so the vulnerable decoders (TIFF, JPEG, FlashPix, Ghostscript...) never run.
# Remove when fastembed allows pillow>=13. Added 2026-11-02.
